/**
 * data/cars.js
 * -----------------------------------------------------------------------
 * The full FH6 car roster (stock/default configuration) - this is the
 * ground truth the roulette uses to keep Car Type -> Country -> Brand ->
 * Decade -> Performance Class rolls from landing on an impossible
 * combination (e.g. a "Kei Car" that's German, or a "Classic Muscle"
 * from the 2020s).
 *
 * Fields:
 *   id      - unique, lowercase, dashes only, never renamed once shipped
 *   name    - in-game display name (year + make + model)
 *   make    - id from data/brands.js
 *   type    - id from data/carTypes.js
 *   country - id from data/countries.js
 *   year    - model year
 *   decade  - id from data/decades.js, derived from `year`
 *   class   - id from data/classes.js - the car's STOCK performance class
 *   pi      - the car's STOCK Performance Index (number)
 *
 * HOW TO ADD A NEW CAR: copy a row, fill in the fields above (decade is
 * just the year rounded down: 1987 -> "1980s", 2554 -> "concept-future"
 * for anything year >= 2030). If the car is a new make, type, or from a
 * country not yet listed, add that to the relevant data file first.
 * -----------------------------------------------------------------------
 */
